  data:
    Id: bear_sen_converge
    DisplayName: Plant the Shield
    Description: 'Unlocks Plant the Shield, which takes over Brace''s button: 30
      Fury. He sets his shield down in front of himself, worth 2 x (Defense + Magical
      Defense) + 10% of his maximum health. It takes the blows aimed at him before
      his health, until it breaks or 3 turns pass; a shield that breaks throws shards
      back at whoever broke it. 3 turns before it can be planted again. Free, gated
      at 9 embers spent in this path.'
    CharacterId: bear
    Column: 0
    Row: 10
